WEBVTT

00:02.020 --> 00:04.730
<b></b>Sabarro Valley, center

00:08.050 --> 00:10.430
Are you all right, Cy?

00:10.430 --> 00:12.670
I-I'm fi—

00:16.280 --> 00:19.990
I hoped you would provide 
more entertainment.

00:20.420 --> 00:22.450
Lante, are you hurt?!

00:23.960 --> 00:26.340
What will you do now?

00:26.340 --> 00:31.960
Count on your ring to save you? 
Its power only works once.

00:33.470 --> 00:34.410
What about my ring?

00:34.800 --> 00:38.440
He imbued it with a portion of his magic.

00:40.120 --> 00:41.760
<i>Then that was...</i>

00:43.010 --> 00:45.020
<i>what protected me that time.</i>

00:47.620 --> 00:49.700
<i>I wasn't imagining things.</i>

00:50.570 --> 00:53.520
<i>No wonder I felt like His Majesty 
was always with me.</i>

00:53.850 --> 00:57.130
You have nothing left to save you.

00:57.130 --> 01:00.750
Now, it is time to tremble in fear.

01:00.750 --> 01:03.790
And if you prostrate yourself before me,

01:03.790 --> 01:06.850
I will make you my queen.

01:07.890 --> 01:08.490
I—

01:08.490 --> 01:09.450
Not on my watch!

01:11.770 --> 01:12.500
Lante?!

01:13.000 --> 01:17.860
Even a hyena will bite a wolf if you 
back him into a corner, moron.

01:20.510 --> 01:24.260
Filthy hyena brat!

01:47.820 --> 01:49.080
Your Majesty!

03:19.970 --> 03:24.970
Rescue and a Fated Duel

03:27.940 --> 03:30.300
There you are at last.

03:30.850 --> 03:35.890
I've never waited for anyone—
or anything—as much as I have for this!

03:35.890 --> 03:38.410
For this chance to face you!

03:40.100 --> 03:42.810
C-C-Cy!

03:42.080 --> 03:44.750
C-C-Clops!

03:47.380 --> 03:50.690
<i>His Majesty is really here...</i>

03:51.620 --> 03:53.000
<i>Right beside me.</i>

03:57.090 --> 03:59.030
It truly is you, then.

03:59.580 --> 04:03.210
The last heir to the former kingdom of wolves...

04:04.050 --> 04:06.600
Fenrir, the 12th prince.

04:06.600 --> 04:08.470
And missing an ear.

04:08.470 --> 04:12.810
I see that you truly were 
driven from your land.

04:13.190 --> 04:16.480
I'm honored that you know so much about me.

04:17.020 --> 04:22.510
King of Ozmargo, ever since you 
became known by that title,

04:22.510 --> 04:28.440
I've lived to fight you again 
and reclaim my stolen pride.

04:28.780 --> 04:32.740
Will your pride return if you defeat me?

04:33.360 --> 04:35.520
And what then?

04:36.260 --> 04:38.660
What will you do when you take the throne?

04:39.060 --> 04:44.390
What? That woman asked the same question.

04:45.080 --> 04:50.030
I'll do just one thing: purge this realm.

04:50.680 --> 04:56.060
All beasts will form up to kill and 
slaughter each other once more!

04:56.060 --> 05:00.070
And the last to survive will reign supreme!

05:00.490 --> 05:06.400
I'll create a world where only might 
matters, for beast and human alike!

05:06.400 --> 05:09.340
H-He's crazy!

05:09.340 --> 05:13.350
Who'd want to bring those ancient wars back?!

05:13.350 --> 05:15.620
But it makes sense, doesn't it?

05:16.630 --> 05:22.850
That chaos led to this kingdom, ruled by 
the leader of the last species standing.

05:23.270 --> 05:28.050
The strong make the rules, 
and the weak follow them.

05:28.590 --> 05:31.010
That's as true now as it was then.

05:32.240 --> 05:35.700
<i>Yes. And that's why His Majesty...</i>

05:36.350 --> 05:41.200
Now, if you want to keep 
your throne, fight me.

05:41.200 --> 05:46.580
Or are you still spouting that 
nonsense about hating combat?

05:47.830 --> 05:51.430
No. You've just given me a fresh reminder

05:51.430 --> 05:55.150
of why I must never cede my throne to you.

05:55.150 --> 05:58.350
As a king, and as a man,

06:00.010 --> 06:03.040
I have things I must protect from you!

06:05.050 --> 06:08.260
<b></b>Sabarro Valley, northeast

06:07.100 --> 06:08.250
Hurry, Jor!

06:08.520 --> 06:11.650
That potent burst of magic 
can mean nothing good.

06:12.050 --> 06:13.950
Fenrir is most likely...

06:16.310 --> 06:17.450
You!

06:17.450 --> 06:19.960
The battle has already begun.

06:20.360 --> 06:22.470
We are no longer needed.

06:22.470 --> 06:24.240
What do you mean?!

06:24.580 --> 06:30.590
My duty now is to ensure 
that no one interferes.

06:31.030 --> 06:33.320
That was my promise to Fenrir.

06:33.850 --> 06:37.000
If you intend to intervene, I'll kill you.

06:37.000 --> 06:39.660
Even if I can't do it honorably.

06:40.360 --> 06:41.480
Very well.

06:42.160 --> 06:45.430
We promise not to meddle 
in our king's battle, as well.

06:45.730 --> 06:46.250
Jor!

06:46.760 --> 06:49.220
It makes no difference, Abi.

06:50.830 --> 06:56.270
The lord of this realm is fighting 
its self-proclaimed new ruler.

06:56.570 --> 07:00.110
We have no place in their duel.

07:09.930 --> 07:13.030
<i>His Majesty is facing forward.</i>

07:15.640 --> 07:18.160
What's wrong?! Is that all you've got?!

07:18.930 --> 07:22.570
<i>He's wearing the face of a king 
who has so much on his shoulders</i>

07:24.180 --> 07:25.600
<i>and staring straight ahead.</i>

07:26.150 --> 07:29.720
<i>All I can do is believe in him.</i>

07:30.660 --> 07:31.850
<i>His Majesty...</i>

07:32.880 --> 07:34.170
Sire!

07:34.830 --> 07:37.050
<i>...will never lose!</i>

07:45.490 --> 07:47.140
Is this it?

07:47.730 --> 07:52.710
That day, your overwhelming magic 
power stole everything from me.

07:53.110 --> 07:57.130
To me, your might was pure despair.

07:57.440 --> 07:59.490
Is this all

07:59.820 --> 08:01.860
a king can do?!

08:02.250 --> 08:03.310
Watch out!

08:18.770 --> 08:20.750
You've gotta be kidding me.

08:22.130 --> 08:24.470
It can't be. His Majesty is...

08:29.810 --> 08:33.320
You exhausted your magic so quickly.

08:33.770 --> 08:39.580
I knew it. You haven't recovered the 
power you put into the woman's ring.

08:39.980 --> 08:43.530
Were you so desperate to 
reach her as soon as possible,

08:43.860 --> 08:48.280
even knowing that you weren't 
at your full strength?

08:50.290 --> 08:56.470
Good. That woman you're head 
over heels for will soon be mine.

08:58.440 --> 09:01.210
But I have something to take care of first.

09:01.650 --> 09:04.390
Using all my mystic power!

09:08.720 --> 09:10.440
S-Sire!

09:14.810 --> 09:15.650
There!

09:24.790 --> 09:26.010
He missed?

09:30.460 --> 09:33.290
What are you playing at?

09:33.290 --> 09:36.170
Now we're on even footing.

09:36.560 --> 09:40.690
Trampling a weaker opponent to reach the top

09:40.690 --> 09:44.180
would only tarnish my royal dignity.

09:44.630 --> 09:46.400
From now on,

09:48.310 --> 09:51.440
we fight like primal beasts!

09:54.900 --> 09:57.880
<i>Refugees are flooding into the royal capital.</i>

09:58.620 --> 10:02.290
<i>Their numbers show how 
uneasy the people feel.</i>

10:03.740 --> 10:09.090
Track His Majesty's holy beast at once! 
It will lead us to the enemy leader!

10:09.090 --> 10:11.540
The acting queen is with them!

10:12.970 --> 10:17.160
<i>Does that mean His Majesty 
will fight after all?</i>

10:18.110 --> 10:21.600
<i>All that I can do is pray,</i>

10:22.340 --> 10:28.350
<i>but please be safe, Lady Sariphi, 
Your Majesty, and everyone else.</i>

10:29.170 --> 10:30.330
<i>And especially...</i>

10:35.990 --> 10:37.640
His Majesty is fighting tooth and claw?

10:37.940 --> 10:38.960
<i>Fenrir...</i>

11:13.250 --> 11:15.010
<i>A deep wound. The king has him.</i>

11:29.930 --> 11:31.820
I'm not finished yet.

11:32.590 --> 11:34.290
<i>This man...</i>

11:34.720 --> 11:40.160
<i>This is obsession—the pride of 
a man who once lost everything.</i>

11:40.490 --> 11:44.310
<i>The obsession of one who strives 
to reclaim his own existence.</i>

11:45.380 --> 11:49.480
<i>Do I have anything to compare to it?</i>

11:52.470 --> 11:56.930
<i>I mustn't let my mind wander. 
This is no time for weakness.</i>

11:57.630 --> 12:01.910
<i>Weakness? Is that not my true essence?</i>

12:02.450 --> 12:07.160
<i>I curse my own existence and 
fear battle due to my own frailty.</i>

12:07.160 --> 12:10.960
<i>Merely clinging to the throne I was 
given is the extent of my power.</i>

12:11.700 --> 12:14.970
<i>So, can... Can I...</i>

12:16.180 --> 12:20.080
<i>possibly triumph over this man?</i>

12:35.480 --> 12:37.990
I am king!

12:56.530 --> 12:59.250
<i>Is it over?</i>

13:00.320 --> 13:04.160
<i>I have... no strength left.</i>

13:04.680 --> 13:06.720
<i>I can no longer... hear anything.</i>

13:08.730 --> 13:09.690
<i>What?</i>

13:14.160 --> 13:15.240
<i>"Le"?</i>

13:16.440 --> 13:17.430
<i>"On"?</i>

13:18.400 --> 13:20.700
Leonhart.

13:21.130 --> 13:22.460
<i>Of course.</i>

13:25.950 --> 13:29.690
<i>Of course. I have that name.</i>

13:30.770 --> 13:33.190
It means "brave-hearted."

13:33.750 --> 13:38.470
<i>That pride you gave to me is the one thing</i>

13:38.860 --> 13:41.970
<i>that no one can take from me!</i>

13:45.060 --> 13:48.540
<i>He... How can he still stand?!</i>

13:48.540 --> 13:49.620
<i>How—</i>

13:51.880 --> 13:53.300
<i>That woman.</i>

13:54.200 --> 13:57.630
<i>She brought this out in him.</i>

13:59.170 --> 14:00.480
<i>I...</i>

14:02.720 --> 14:07.480
<i>Fenrir is afraid, just like he was back then.</i>

14:08.240 --> 14:11.500
My ear... My ear is...

14:11.840 --> 14:13.490
Y-Your Highness...

14:13.490 --> 14:18.060
I... I brought Your Highness water.

14:18.060 --> 14:18.910
Stop it!

14:19.700 --> 14:21.560
Don't call me that!

14:21.560 --> 14:23.660
I'm not royalty anymore.

14:23.660 --> 14:25.670
I lost my ear and everything else.

14:25.670 --> 14:27.150
I'm a stray dog!

14:27.150 --> 14:30.020
You're not my servant anymore! Go away!

14:31.490 --> 14:32.450
Nir!

14:35.990 --> 14:37.000
What are you...

14:37.000 --> 14:40.540
If... If you want an ear, I'll give you mine.

14:40.540 --> 14:42.520
I'll do whatever you say.

14:43.240 --> 14:48.490
S-So please, keep me with you!

14:49.930 --> 14:50.920
<i>Fenrir...</i>

14:51.400 --> 14:57.080
<i>I was just a stray dog until you gave 
me a name and a place to belong.</i>

14:57.080 --> 14:58.250
Nir.

14:58.250 --> 15:01.290
I swear I'll be king of this country someday.

15:01.290 --> 15:06.890
Until then, I'm just plain Fenrir. 
Act accordingly.

15:06.890 --> 15:10.050
This country? You mean the kingdom of wolves?

15:10.050 --> 15:13.300
No, I mean the whole beast realm.

15:13.630 --> 15:18.350
One day, he'll become king. 
Then I'll beat him and take over.

15:18.350 --> 15:21.460
So don't go anywhere. Stay by my side.

15:22.930 --> 15:23.800
<i>One day,</i>

15:24.160 --> 15:25.660
<i>you </i>will<i> be king.</i>

15:26.270 --> 15:30.700
Fenrir! Take it back! Reclaim your pride!

15:37.630 --> 15:38.820
<i>I...</i>

15:38.820 --> 15:40.300
<i>I...</i>

15:40.300 --> 15:41.760
<i>...cannot lose!</i>

15:56.480 --> 15:58.760
This is a complete...

16:02.430 --> 16:03.320
Yes!

16:03.320 --> 16:04.950
Hooray!

16:04.950 --> 16:07.130
His Majesty won!

16:07.130 --> 16:08.710
He did it, Sari!

16:08.710 --> 16:09.550
Sari?

16:14.060 --> 16:18.510
Forgive me, Sariphi. Did I worry you?

16:18.510 --> 16:19.530
No.

16:19.820 --> 16:22.490
I believed in you, Leo.

16:25.530 --> 16:26.410
Leo?

16:26.410 --> 16:27.870
Leo, are you all right?!

16:27.870 --> 16:29.580
Sire! In front of you!

16:30.870 --> 16:34.000
He still lives! Quickly, finish him!

16:39.000 --> 16:40.070
Sire...

16:40.470 --> 16:42.610
Have no fear, Sariphi.

16:43.740 --> 16:47.640
<i>For the future of Ozmargo and its people,</i>

16:50.180 --> 16:54.360
<i>I must not show this man 
a shred of compassion.</i>

16:55.120 --> 16:57.650
<i>The king must condemn him.</i>

16:58.100 --> 17:01.140
<i></i>I<i> must, by my own hand.</i>

17:01.140 --> 17:02.370
That won't be necessary.

17:11.800 --> 17:14.580
Wh-Why would that man strike Fenrir?!

17:14.920 --> 17:19.290
Now my job is done, 
and so is my reason to live.

17:19.290 --> 17:20.240
It's all...

17:22.060 --> 17:23.150
Wait!

17:23.150 --> 17:25.190
Do you...

17:32.420 --> 17:34.620
I refuse to let him escape!

17:34.620 --> 17:35.940
We must give chase!

17:36.560 --> 17:37.650
Sire!

17:39.350 --> 17:40.580
Sire!

17:41.190 --> 17:46.500
<i>We got on Gwiber and rode 
straight back to the capital.</i>

17:46.950 --> 17:51.250
Gather every priest in the palace! 
Have them tend to His Majesty!

17:51.250 --> 17:52.470
Make haste!

17:53.920 --> 17:55.350
Lady Sariphi...

18:00.690 --> 18:03.930
<i>Nir, who took Fenrir and vanished,</i>

18:04.520 --> 18:06.900
<i>was made a wanted man throughout Ozmargo.</i>

18:08.380 --> 18:11.990
<i>A few days later, the injured Lante was...</i>

18:14.840 --> 18:18.970
I see that these events 
have changed your outlook.

18:19.330 --> 18:20.290
Not really.

18:20.610 --> 18:23.210
But Sariphi told me something.

18:24.150 --> 18:26.700
Guards aren't there to die 
for whoever they serve.

18:27.700 --> 18:31.040
We're there to watch over them 
until their job is done.

18:33.880 --> 18:35.140
So I'm gonna...

18:35.490 --> 18:36.840
In that case,

18:38.040 --> 18:41.270
you must recover from those 
wounds as soon as possible

18:41.270 --> 18:44.530
so that you can protect the 
queen with all your might.

18:45.640 --> 18:51.820
I will be happy to face you then, 
Captain Lanteveldt of the Queen's Guard.

18:55.760 --> 18:56.610
Right!

18:59.620 --> 19:04.220
Thank you for sparring with me, 
Captain Jormungand of the Royal Guard.

19:05.680 --> 19:07.930
<i>And as for His Majesty...</i>

19:14.300 --> 19:15.410
Sire.

19:18.310 --> 19:20.210
Oh, did I wake you?

19:21.250 --> 19:22.260
No.

19:23.380 --> 19:27.900
So, Mr. Chancellor said that 
we need to stay on the alert,

19:27.900 --> 19:32.180
since we don't know when Nir 
will try to take revenge on you.

19:33.680 --> 19:37.360
I doubt that I will ever see him again.

19:38.780 --> 19:42.070
Sire, what did you and he 
talk about at the end?

19:42.670 --> 19:46.410
I asked him if he hated me 
for striking down his lord.

19:47.560 --> 19:49.110
And he said...

19:49.410 --> 19:55.170
This fight was Fenrir's long-cherished 
dream, and also his curse.

19:55.750 --> 19:58.180
At last, Fenrir is free.

19:59.190 --> 20:00.350
I thank you for that.

20:03.530 --> 20:06.920
The winds have turned cold, 
haven't they, Fenrir?

20:08.990 --> 20:14.230
I know why you entrusted me 
with that final duty.

20:14.710 --> 20:16.780
Nir, I'll only say this once.

20:17.320 --> 20:21.720
If he defeats me, and he's 
about to take my life,

20:22.420 --> 20:24.980
I want you to kill me first.

20:25.420 --> 20:29.250
Such talk isn't like you.

20:29.250 --> 20:32.450
It isn't. And that's why I'll never say it again.

20:33.390 --> 20:37.710
<i>You were robbed of your ear and your pride.</i>

20:38.170 --> 20:44.210
<i>You lost your title, family, and homeland. 
Only your own life was left to you.</i>

20:44.520 --> 20:47.780
<i>You wanted to give me that at the very end.</i>

20:48.730 --> 20:53.450
<i>From the moment we met until now, 
you've been my reason for living.</i>

20:53.980 --> 20:57.730
<i>Fenrir, you are my pride.</i>

20:58.600 --> 20:59.660
<i>And...</i>

20:59.660 --> 21:00.890
<i>Nir!</i>

21:01.280 --> 21:03.870
Nir! Where did you go?!

21:04.140 --> 21:06.980
I told you to come right away when I call.

21:07.390 --> 21:13.500
That means you need to stay by my side, 
always close enough to hear me.

21:13.870 --> 21:15.950
Come on! Hurry up!

21:16.540 --> 21:17.610
<i>Nir!</i>

21:18.910 --> 21:19.880
<i>And...</i>

21:20.780 --> 21:27.230
<i>you are the only king I recognize, 
prouder than any other.</i>

22:59.550 --> 23:02.130
Now that the king has repelled the rebels,

23:02.130 --> 23:05.850
the people support him even 
more staunchly than before.

23:06.170 --> 23:09.610
Yes, nothing ever goes 
quite as one hopes it will.

23:10.190 --> 23:14.760
So to gain my objective, 
I must find it myself after all.

23:15.380 --> 23:19.130
I know that the thing I seek exists

23:20.060 --> 23:23.530
somewhere in this forbidden archive.

23:25.860 --> 23:28.160
Are your wounds better now, sire?

23:28.160 --> 23:30.200
Yes, you need fear no longer.

23:30.200 --> 23:31.410
Thank goodness!

23:31.410 --> 23:35.260
Wait, Sariphi. I wish to tell you something.

23:35.690 --> 23:39.450
Something of grave importance 
to this kingdom's future.

23:36.970 --> 23:39.970
Next Episode

23:36.970 --> 23:39.970
A Bridge Between Beasts and Humans
